=== Burning Soul of the Virtuous ===
Get yourself keyed access to the [[Plane of Sky|Plane of Sky's]] island 4, the one with the flying horses and griffins. Careful of the [[An Essence Carrier|an essence carrier]] mobs, as they are scowls, ready to attack. Make sure you have a safe path from island 1 up to inside island 4's windmill. You can use invisibility to go unnoticed.

Next, go to the quest room from Island 1, with all the Efreeti. You can either leave the instance and renter, jump off an island, or cycle up past island 8: Veeshan's Island to get back to island 1 to be able to enter the quest island. 

Find [[Dason Goldblade]] and prepare for a fight.

Give Dason Goldblade 500 platinum, and this will spawn [[Inte Akera]], a level 55 Paladin, inside island 4's windmill. He will only stay up for a limited time. Hurry up to Island 4's windmill, and you will see him sitting down inside the windmill. If you still have the faction, he will consider you an ally, and when you hail him, he will say:

: Inte Akera says, 'Greetings, _____.  I am Inte Akera. I have retired to the Plane of Sky after a long life toiling on Norrath's soil.  Have you retreated here as well, or are you merely visiting?'

Murder [[Inte Akera]]. You will get the usual faction hits from killing him.

Loot the [[Burning Soul of the Virtuous]] and right-click it:

: As you stare into the fading embers within your palm, the fear of your mistakes overwhelms you as the visage of Jotayi's vengeance upon Inte echoes from the beyond. You are left with a long silence and have no conclusions left to draw from. You clasp the flames away in disgust, and close your eyes to seek inward. A voice calls out to you from the void. "Still the gods' plaything, are you? A miserable fate we all have come to learn. You'll not find any truth despite their promises. It has led me only to selfish spite. My name is Luxio, I was once a knight such as you. If you still need guidance, seek me out in Freeport amidst the rest of the forsaken rabble."

=== Torrid Corruptor ===

Get <b>Kindly</b> or higher [[Dismal Rage]] faction. [[Assist the Great Xelha]] quest in [[East Freeport]] is probably the easiest method:
* 4x [[Bone Chips]] increases faction by 5. 
* 4x [[Fire Beetle Eye|Fire Beetle Eyes]] increases faction by 10.
* 4x [[Spiderling Silk]] increases faction by 10.
** The [[Paineel]] newbie yard is a great place to get [[Bone Chips]] and [[Fire Beetle Eye|Fire Beetle Eyes]]. In the northernmost corner of the yard, there are 2 spots that respawn ''very'' quickly- one spot spawns 3 [[A Fire Beetle|fire beetles]] and the other spawns 4 [[A Decaying Skeleton|decaying skeletons]]. If you can kill them fast enough, you can loot about 400 [[Bone Chips]] ''and'' 400 [[Fire Beetle Eye|Fire Beetle Eyes]] in about an hour. 

Find [[Luxio Nulsis]] in the East Freeport tunnels near the [[Shadow Knight]] and [[Necromancer]] guild masters. He won't respond to hails: 

: Luxio Nulsis says, 'Leave me, I have no interest in speaking with you.'

However, tell Luxio "'''I still seek guidance'''":

: Luxio Nulsis says, 'So, you've finally sought me out. It is unfortunate to see you still carry the guilt of your past with you. I know that feeling all too well. I can only advise to be rid of it once and for all. If you wish, as a fellow knight, I will take the sword and the three souls you've collected. This burden I will carry for you.'

Give him the three Souls and the [[Soulfire]]:

